{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, what you need to do is to summon soldiers to fall from the sky and eliminate the enemy in an instant when your people's lives are hanging by a thread</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/extras/chapter1_1.gif?t=1740820906\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to combine soldier cards and effect cards in a reasonable way to summon soldiers with various effects to deal with various situations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/extras/chapter2_1.gif?t=1740820906\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also use magic cards to restrain enemies and work together with other cards to more efficiently eliminate them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/extras/chapter3_3.gif?t=1740820906\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537650?t=1740820906","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740820906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/7633e140a9b39b96257dcc10929596f144aa412b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740820906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/7633e140a9b39b96257dcc10929596f144aa412b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740820906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3539290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, what you need to do is to summon soldiers to fall from the sky and eliminate the enemy in an instant when your people's lives are hanging by a thread</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/extras/chapter1_1.gif?t=1740820906\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to combine soldier cards and effect cards in a reasonable way to summon soldiers with various effects to deal with various situations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/extras/chapter2_1.gif?t=1740820906\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also use magic cards to restrain enemies and work together with other cards to more efficiently eliminate them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/extras/chapter3_3.gif?t=1740820906\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["HU9940007"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537650/header.jpg?t=1740820906","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098992,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098992/movie480.mp4?t=1740816927","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098992/movie_max.mp4?t=1740816927"},"name":"\u5929\u964d\u795e\u5175\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098992/ea2f72e8dad3908bb6bcaa4ffc350544f9b69f83/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740816927","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers